        "original_id": "e732c041-d05b-5c58-887f-26b61522827d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Moon Embracing the Sun\n- People: Kim Soo-hyun, Han Ga-in, Jung Il-woo, Kim Min-seo\n- Organizations: MBC\n\nFacts:\n- Kim Soo-hyun was born on February 16, 1988, and he is a South Korean actor.\n- Kim Soo-hyun is best known for his roles in the television dramas \"Dream High\" (2011), \"Moon Embracing the Sun\" (2012), \"My Love from the Star\" (2013), and \"The Producers\" (2015).\n- Kim Soo-hyun is also known for his roles in the films \"The Thieves\" (2012), \"Secretly, Greatly\" (2013), and \"Real\" (2017).\n- Moon Embracing the Sun, also known as The Moon That Embraces the Sun or The Sun and the Moon, is a 2012 South Korean television drama series.\n- Moon Embracing the Sun stars Kim Soo-hyun, Han Ga-in, Jung Il-woo, and Kim Min-seo.\n- MBC aired Moon Embracing the Sun from January 4 to March 15, 2012, on Wednesdays and Thursdays at 21:55 for 20 episodes.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "c6f7fe62-d1f2-553d-8559-e3a3b383351e",
        "text": "Page: Moon Embracing the Sun. Sentence: Moon Embracing the Sun (, also known as The Moon That Embraces the Sun or The Sun and the Moon) is a 2012 South Korean television drama series, starring Kim Soo-hyun, Han Ga-in, Jung Il-woo and Kim Min-seo.\nPage: Moon Embracing the Sun. Sentence: It aired on MBC from January 4 to March 15, 2012, on Wednesdays and Thursdays at 21:55 for 20 episodes.\nPage: Kim Soo-hyun. Sentence: Kim Soo-hyun (; born February 16, 1988) is a South Korean actor best known for his roles in the television dramas \"Dream High\" (2011), \"Moon Embracing the Sun\" (2012), \"My Love from the Star\" (2013) and \"The Producers\" (2015), as well as the films \"The Thieves\" (2012) , \"Secretly, Greatly\" (2013) and \"Real\" (2017).",
